"intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAMIKAWAJI, MINAKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUMOTO, HIROO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A process for the preparation of alcohol (1), characterized by conducting palladium-catalyzed coupling of p-iodochlorobenzene with allyl alcohol in the presence of tetramethylammonium chloride and reducing the obtained product; and a process for the preparation of compound (2), characterized by brominating the alcohol (1) obtained by the above process.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de préparation d'alcool (1), caractérisé en ce qu'on effectue un couplage, catalysé au palladium, de p-iodochlorobenzène avec l'alcool allylique, en présence de chlorure de tétraméthylammonium, et en ce qu'on réduit le produit obtenu. L'invention concerne en outre un procédé de préparation du composé (2), caractérisé en ce qu'on effectue la bromation de l'alcool (1) obtenu par le procédé précité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>